  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/MacrorretratoFiestasTorralba.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(15 fotos) El macrorretrato realizado a mediod&iacute;a de este s&aacute;bado en la plaza de Torralba del Pinar ha marcado la recta final de las fiestas en agosto, que finalizan este domingo con misa y procesi&oacute;n en honor al patr&oacute;n, el Sant&iacute;simo Salvador.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torralbadelpinar17/img_0512.jpg\" alt=\"img_0512\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torralbadelpinar17/img_0513.jpg\" alt=\"img_0513\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torralbadelpinar17/img_0515.jpg\" alt=\"img_0515\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torralbadelpinar17/img_0518.jpg\" alt=\"img_0518\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torralbadelpinar17/img_0520.jpg\" alt=\"img_0520\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torralbadelpinar17/img_0525.jpg\" alt=\"img_0525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torralbadelpinar17/img_0526.jpg\" alt=\"img_0526\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torralbadelpinar17/img_0530.jpg\" alt=\"img_0530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/torralbadelpinar17/img_0531.jpg\" alt=\"img_0531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/